            "content": "主机音频（WAV/麦克风, 8 kHz, 8-bit）\n   │  0xCC | len | N×sample | checksum\n   ▼\nUART 256k → UARTReader → 音频包解析 → 1 kB FIFO\n                                          │ 8 kHz\n                                          ▼\n                                   sigma-delta @5.12 MHz\n                                          │ 1-bit gate\n                                          ▼\n",
